{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38956","headline":"和舍弟题书堂 · 杜荀鹤","name":"和舍弟题书堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兄弟将知大自强，乱时同葺读书堂。\n岩泉遇雨多还闹，溪竹唯风少即凉。\n藉草醉吟花片落，傍山闲步药苗香。\n团圆便是家肥事，何必盈仓与满箱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}